{"step_index":954,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:22:33Z","thinking":"When a Bizno search returns zero results, it displays recommendations; these recommendations aren't necessarily related to the original query. Therefore, the search result's title must be validated to ensure it contains the company name from the initial query. For example, if searching for \"동아대학교출판부\" yields \"피치아이앤디,\" it's a zero-result fallback and requires correction.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test naver search for business numbers\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const { fetchNaverSearch, extractBizNumbersFromText } = require('./naver_utils');\\n\\nasync function testNaver() {\\n  const queries = [\\n    '동아대학교출판부 사업자등록번호',\\n    '동아대학교출판부 부산',\\n    '\\\"나래바람\\\" \\\"051-612-2133\\\"',\\n    '도서출판일광 기장',\\n    '\\\"동화사\\\" \\\"051-464-0761\\\"',\\n    '\\\"한국산업정보사\\\" \\\"051-504-6877\\\"'\\n  ];\\n\\n  for (const q of queries) {\\n    const html = await fetchNaverSearch(q);\\n    const biznos = extractBizNumbersFromText(html);\\n    console.log(`Query: [${q}] -> Found BizNos:`, biznos);\\n    // find snippets\\n    const snippetRegex = /.{0,50}(?:\\\\d{3}-\\\\d{2}-\\\\d{5}|동아대학교출판부|나래바람|도서출판일광).{0,50}/g;\\n    // show first 2 snippets\\n    const m = html.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').match(snippetRegex);\\n    if (m && m.length > 0) {\\n      console.log(' Snippets:', m.slice(0, 2).map(s => s.trim().replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ')));\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\ntestNaver();\\n\"","Description":"\"Test Naver search for business numbers\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\scratch\\\\test_naver_bizno.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating test_naver_bizno.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Test Naver search for bizno\""}}]}
